OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLow cloud and drizzle quickly
OL,6,Flifting to brighter skies, with plenty
OL,7,Fof hazy spells of sunshine developing.
OL,8,FAn isolated light shower or two may be
OL,9,Fpossible, mainly during the afternoon.
OL,10,FFeeling warm and muggy, with light
OL,11,Fwinds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud increasing from the
OL,14,Fnorth during the evening, with a
OL,15,Fperiod of heavy rain moving southwards
OL,16,Fby late evening and during the early
OL,17,Fhours. Staying cloudy and damp until
OL,18,Fdawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
