OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FBrightening up, after a
OL,6,Fcloudy and damp start, with sunny
OL,7,Fspells and a scattering of light
OL,8,Fshowers. Feeling a little cooler, but
OL,9,Fstill pleasant in the sunnier moments.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,12,Fspells and showers expected throughout
OL,13,Fthis period. Some of the showers will
OL,14,Fbe heavy and times, with the risk of
OL,15,Fhail and thunder. A fresh feel for all.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
